      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FEDERAL SNIPER (5) goes very well at this journey here having never missed the frame including three wins. Was out of the placings last time (20.53) at Goulburn in a NG, finishing sixth and beaten 13 lengths. Looks a leading chance on best. RED REIGN (7) is a promising type who notched his 9th career success when too good (29.75) at Wentworth Park last time. Solid record here winning six races. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Can make it back-to-back wins. ANALYSER (8) broke a four run winning streak last start when third and beaten 3.5 lengths (17.87) last time at Richmond Straight. Has never been out of the money in three starts this distance. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Can feature again. GROUND CONTROL (1) has a solid strike rate from this box.",
